<p><strong><font color="blue">Latest news</font> </strong><small>Posted Wednesday, December 11, 2002 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Well, the patch for today is actually for tomorrow.. So, Patch at 3am on Thursday morning.<br><br>Found this on the Everquest boards, of interest to all healers:<br><br><b>Healing Agro in Planes of Power</b><br>We are aware that there is a problem with healing generating too much agro (upsetting the monsters) in Planes of Power.  We are working on a fix for this problem.  It should show up on the Test server fairly soon, but we probably will not have it ready for the patch tonight.<br><br>Alan<br><br><br><br></p>
