<p><strong><font color="blue">Our on the spot reporter, Aeos, has this to say</font> </strong><small>Posted Tuesday, November 19, 2002 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Whilest heading to ToV, I read this in guild chat, me thinks Anaa is a little to obsessed:<br> <img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/anna.jpg"><br><br>Poor Choppin, he got killed and still doesn't know it, he's still trying to walk away <a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/choppin.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/choppin_small.jpg"></a><br><br>Well, after leaving ToV a group of us decided to take on some of the critters in the Planes of Power and this intrepid reporter managed to get a shot of this little spider in the Planes of Nightmare:<br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/consort.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/consort_small.jpg"></a>,<nobr> wonder who's consort she is.. EWWW!</nobr><br><br>Well, after having enough nightmares to fill my day, the call went out to move into Sleepers Tomb. Since the Sleeper was wakened, the locals are now calling it Kerafyrm's Lair.. go figure..<br><br>At any rate, I managed to get off some shots of the inhabitants of this place.<br><br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/motg1.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/motg1_small.jpg"></a> This is the Master of the Guard<br><br>While we were fighting the Master, these boys showed up and were promptly kited around by Glencannon and Choppin:<br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/kiting1.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/kiting1_small.jpg"></a> <a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/kiting2.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/kiting2_small.jpg"></a><br><br>and here is one of us looting the now dead Master of the Guard and his stash: <a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/motg2.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/motg2_small.jpg"></a><br><br>Then we moved on in a ways and came across this nasty, this guy calls himself the Progenitor: <a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/prog1.jpg target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/prog1_small.jpg"></a> <a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/prog2.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/prog2_small.jpg"></a> <br>and then we find this nice stuff as we clean out his pockets after he fell to our might: <br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/prog3.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/prog3_small.jpg"></a><br><br>Now, were still in the Masters hall when we come across this little wyvern was standing in our way, preventing us from entering the library so we took him out. <br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/arcwyv.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/arcwyv_small.jpg"></a> <br><br>Once into the library we came across this librarian called a colloquial antagonist, wasn't very friendly when Palimax asked for the book of the dead and got very rude to us in general, so we mopped up the floor with him.<br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/colloant.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/colloant_small.jpg"></a><br><br>Seems Palimax wasn't finished for the day either, he went and raised one of our fallen comrades to fight along side us, poor Inzo.<br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/palipet.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/palipet_small.jpg"></a> and then we ran into these armies, the undead, long awaited by Necromancers and Paladins alike, <br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/phan.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/phan_small.jpg"></a> <br>but this guy ended our fun in Kerafyrm's Lair for this trip,<br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/milas.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/milas_small.jpg"></a>, was red to our 65th members..<br><br><br>Well, after recovering from our defeat in Kerafyrm's Lair a few of us hearty explorers headed up to the Plane of Storms where I was able to get a few more shots before my head hit the pillow. This fellow took only one group. <br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/irmin.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/irmin_small.jpg"></a> <br>After some reinforcements joined us we took out this guy:<br><a href="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/kokachief.jpg" target=blank><img src="http://www.merke-ich-mir-doch-ganz-leicht.org/va/kokachief_small.jpg"></a>. <br><br>Well, after all this I'm off to make my camp and get some rest.. My poor feet are tired. <br>Aeos, Chanter of Vallis Aspectus<br></p>
