<p><strong><font color="blue">What are we doing?</font> </strong><small>Posted Monday, November 4, 2002 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Well, to answer that question we've been running around trying to get through the Trials and exploring the Planes of Power. Wish that Verant had put in the virtual zones as were hinted at. As it is, only one group at a time can do a trial and if that groups succeeds in winning the trial it takes 30 mins to reset. So, long que's are to be expected whilest you wait your turn to do a trial.<br><br>The merger of Vision and Vallis Scortor is going well, we're getting to know each other better and learn what we can accomplish. And what we've accomplished so far has been very impressive. We have a large presence in all timezones and have been able to mobilize quickly and take out the targets of opportunity that we've had eye's out looking for very efficently.</p>
