<p><strong><font color="blue">Another good day for Vallis Aspectus.</font> </strong><small>Posted Thursday, October 31, 2002 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Well, seems the Vindicator likes to fall to the might of Vallis Aspectus, his head rolled again. After he fell, we set our sights on The Statue of Rallos Zek. Now this intreped reporter heard that there was some ping pong action going on the argo from SoT. For some reason SoT couldn't keep from getting argo on him and at one point he almost wiped out their raid force. Eventually things got sorted out and The Statue fell to our might and gave up some nice loot for our merry band of adventurers.<br><br>Well, after fun in Kael, our merry bunch of slayers moved out to Western Wastes and took on that big meanie, Klandicar. Once again, he fell to our might and the day was ours once again.<br><br>Grats to those that got some trinkets from those silly guys. <br><br>So far, nothing to scary on the Halloween front, but then all the news isn't in yet. I'll let you know more tomorrow if I hear of any juicy ghost stories.</p>
