<p><strong><font color="blue">What we did today.</font> </strong><small>Posted Wednesday, October 30, 2002 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Well, seems as if Vallis Aspectus was busy today. First there was a slaying of Severlious, and he dropped a green scale which was awarded to Smobb, our big fat warrior for his epic. It was all he was waiting on and well deserved.<br><br>Next We moved on to Klandicar and he fell to a flawless attack, whilest in Western Wastes, our fearless foes took out Guardian Kozzalym for Choppin.<br><br>Well, after that, a bunch came out to help Silvermaine escort General Bragmar to the Gnomish pirate camp for the 8th shawl. This escort went off without a hitch and Silvermaine finished her 8th shawl.<br><br>All and all, nice day, the merged might of Vallis Aspectus is comming together nicely and we're becomming a fighting force to be reckoned with.</p>
