<p><strong><font color="blue">Monk Fist Change (Ouch)</font> </strong><small>Posted Wednesday, October 30, 2002 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Alan VanCouvering recently announced that the damage/delay ratio on Monk fists at Level 65 will soon be reduced. Here's what he had to say:<br> <br>Hi folks, <br>We're going to have to change this a bit with the next patch. We'll be reducing the power of the monk fist somewhat. It's just not going to work out as it is, it's just too good - the improvement is too dramatic over the level range and for the 'effort' required to get this 'weapon'. <br><br>Obviously we don't want to bring you more news like this, but this much of an improvement just wasn't intended. <br><br>- Alan <br><br><br><a href="http://pub35.ezboard.com/fmonklybusiness43508frm1.showMessage?topicID=33809.topic&index=203" target=blank>Monkly Business</a> reported yesterday that the damage/delay for fists at Level 65 was 18:20. <br><br><br></p>
