<p><strong><font color="blue">WoW, what a fun day.</font> </strong><small>Posted Tuesday, October 29, 2002 by <a href="mailto:silvermaine@vallisscortor.com">Silvermaine</a></small><br>Well, their I was just grinding away when the call went out to gather the forces and raid the day away.<br><br>Our first stop was the Plane of Fear, there to kill the Broken Golem for our Guildie Fuloo. Well, the BG went down and we find the Wraith of Shissar up, next you know she is down and Jess gets the head. With mop up done, we port off to Western Wastes to Slay Klandicar for that key he holds. So, Klandi drops to our might and then its off to Kael because the Vindicator was talking trash about us and we just had to set him straight. So, Our mighty force moves on into Kael and we slap him around really good for that trash talk and put him out of his misery. <br><br>Ok, now you'd think we're done for the day.. nope.. we're off to Velks to slay the Sorcerer who was making fun of Fuloo and his new epic. On the way to the Sorcerers room we find Beldrek up and wandering around and we just slapped him around till he gave up his loot. Then we move to Velketor's front door and take out his guards, then proceed to take over his throne room and slap that silly sorcerer around. Well, now that we'd taken care of him, the remainder of our forces decided to head on down to the basement and check on Lord "theguywiththereallylongunpronaunceablename", aka BOB, (Lord Doljonijiarnimorinar) and slap him around. Well, seems our reputation preceeded us and he high tailed it for the hills like the yellow cur he is. (translation, he wasn't up).<br><br>So, all in all a very productive day. Grats To Fuloo on his brand new Epic. Grats to all others who got some really nice loot.</p>
